{"id": "clm:888877e39b45b9a9091671edf8f342185f7a8857172230677e14d668284486d0", "type": "statement", "text": "Monitor per-engine replanned deltas per unit time on each process; restart resets serverStatus statistics. This sampling method is an inference from counter semantics and restart behavior. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/TOOLS-3659", "https://proxy-hk.tencentcloud.com/document/product/240/81407"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6a37504fb35aea4500f326e6f29ddecab9a9bc20029bfef001297ac099397afd", "ev:6cd9c0956a55025a0c39ecd78b42357dbcdbfa9db5576ccf221b4a1b0b39a78d", "ev:b9fe69496631f08f96e5f677c7fa964b3863cca5fd10d5a1bcdbada20bbbc536"]}
{"id": "clm:56ee521b524a60f003a9e80c3cdf49ec46ff1c5140cd193657cb3161d76cb48a", "type": "statement", "text": "Read db.serverStatus().metrics.query.planCache for plan-cache statistics. MongoDB reports separate classic and sbe engine subdocuments; observe both when investigating replanning across engine workloads. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://proxy-hk.tencentcloud.com/document/product/240/81407"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:6cd9c0956a55025a0c39ecd78b42357dbcdbfa9db5576ccf221b4a1b0b39a78d"]}
{"id": "clm:4ea96acd64dfab036f8a898f2d7d5c1411948288a9f5a0418a0ed6f9c28cebd6", "type": "statement", "text": "classic.replanned and sbe.replanned count query plans discarded and re-optimized. The feature was designed to expose replanning frequency for diagnostics because high replanning rates may accompany performance problems. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-87572"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:e050990c9c505bdf551a5e5a79ff51edd0e5d6fd41bd95c42af6dd2c8d43a908"]}
{"id": "clm:6d5de540a2dc1cafcd7c7f7e896ab9aa1dc23b4d44f6434964e681bcbb4f75a2", "type": "statement", "text": "Avoid copying the JusDB article's totalSizeOfPlanCacheEntriesInBytes example as the documented field name. The official planCache reference uses totalSizeEstimateBytes; JusDB also presents totalPlanCacheEntriesInvalidated, which is absent from the cited reference's planCache field list. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "how-to", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.jusdb.com/blog/mongodb-plancache-memory-issue-sbe-fix"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:c3ab0e24fdef1423d15fe50fa33319496e2d64d40b5bb27fffec0df78c4b7fb1"]}
{"id": "clm:29881ab6a28bfe68c3c3184528f69918baea225328522f324b3f39336ff9bd55", "type": "statement", "text": "Operational inference: compare counter changes over an observation interval and correlate increasing replanned values with query-specific slow-log replanReason evidence before attributing an instance-wide rise to a particular query loop. Tencent recommends this correlation, while MongoDB describes the counter as a frequency diagnostic. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://proxy-hk.tencentcloud.com/document/product/240/81407", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-87572", "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/TOOLS-3659"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6cd9c0956a55025a0c39ecd78b42357dbcdbfa9db5576ccf221b4a1b0b39a78d", "ev:c4d24a698ca6812e30a52ced767b4558d80a3750e4658892c3f0513c312ba64f", "ev:e050990c9c505bdf551a5e5a79ff51edd0e5d6fd41bd95c42af6dd2c8d43a908"]}
{"id": "clm:e1e6ef5770038837666369201eab3073336eeafe739987422c094f2ccbe40c5e", "type": "statement", "text": "totalQueryShapes is an approximate cached-query-shape count, and totalSizeEstimateBytes measures plan-cache bytes. They describe cache occupancy rather than replanning events; the manual dates their grouping under planCache to 7.2 and names the older query.planCacheTotalQueryShapes and query.planCacheTotalSizeEstimateBytes paths. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/", "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/COMPASS-7229"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144"]}
{"id": "clm:8edec7b1b2c863ff364074d0bccd483d9b7d0f2ad9b1b1dfed24a45d3fe4f318", "type": "statement", "text": "Inspect db.serverStatus().metrics.query.planCache; classic and sbe expose separate hits, misses and replanned counters. hits measures cached-plan reuse; misses measures absence followed by planning. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/COMPASS-7229", "https://proxy-hk.tencentcloud.com/document/product/240/81407"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:6cd9c0956a55025a0c39ecd78b42357dbcdbfa9db5576ccf221b4a1b0b39a78d"]}
{"id": "clm:8695aef946b0927e015f3f8fa379d3ba62015f26cdba2bb6f57f44786c926bdc", "type": "statement", "text": "The engine-specific replanned counters count discarded cached plans that undergo re-optimization. They are distinct from misses, which can occur without a previously cached plan. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/TOOLS-3659"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144"]}
{"id": "clm:bbc7b60719a769891dd816396677c02a59a369075080efaf0306cecfde346566", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB documents classic.replanned and sbe.replanned as new in 8.0 and also available in 7.0.22; dashboards must check the deployed patch version before expecting these fields. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144"]}
{"id": "clm:0398b72640569923e842a9bfdce5202ac7697ad32a3a7b31429121aa7a210826", "type": "statement", "text": "classic.skipped and sbe.skipped distinguish cache-ineligible queries from ordinary cache misses. MongoDB documents these fields as new in 7.3; SERVER-75678 lists 7.3.0-rc0 and explicitly motivates separating ineligible queries from absent cache entries. (high confidence) (verified as of 2024-01-19)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-75678"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0e3dc94df41f129781c1eda70e7791f68f0b6ad75f6071a2ef0ea0226691ab6e", "ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144"]}
{"id": "clm:46c43d4f066238292329ad65ad920c2d904a8488053260dbdb53ca06acee15d4", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB 8.2 adds classic.replanned_plan_is_cached_plan and sbe.replanned_plan_is_cached_plan for replanning that produces an identical cached plan. Replanning therefore does not establish index switching. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6a37504fb35aea4500f326e6f29ddecab9a9bc20029bfef001297ac099397afd"]}
{"id": "clm:ab8ac065aa649278c31f1977d5e0070ae1e9a41cf2bafa0ed5378674998f6ef5", "type": "statement", "text": "The JusDB monitoring example names totalSizeOfPlanCacheEntriesInBytes; MongoDB documentation and the relocation ticket instead name totalSizeEstimateBytes. Verify actual server output before adopting that example. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.jusdb.com/blog/mongodb-plancache-memory-issue-sbe-fix", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/COMPASS-7229"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:29b578eb602e114453a9ffe042c7fc786ec9e4d7ca7eed445e065f521ae465cf", "ev:c3ab0e24fdef1423d15fe50fa33319496e2d64d40b5bb27fffec0df78c4b7fb1"]}
{"id": "clm:d8f2332b9fedb960aa2ff902e4582d69d7d45d40e0b4b9d0c3f81b212cac5777", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-127703 records migration of PlanCache counters to OpenTelemetry metrics with fix version 9.0.0-rc0; the ticket alone does not establish availability in a deployed stable release. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-127703", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8b5de25498b3d234a4b149a40c2df0c856368bb7f53c97041713d71a4fef27ee"]}
{"id": "clm:7fc259bfe810b558498ab4691c11ee8b0b5f4066504ab0d0d7a29b54f0d41893", "type": "statement", "text": "Within each engine subdocument, hits counts query plans found in cache and reused to avoid planning; misses counts plans absent from cache that went through planning. A miss is not the same event definition as discarded-plan re-optimization. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144"]}
{"id": "clm:2aaca8c12131d94abf5a8890897376fbf5dd75480d7fd78c65e017fb4d893535", "type": "statement", "text": "Do not assume every 8.0 patch exposes replanned. Although the manual labels the counters new in 8.0 and also available in 7.0.22, SERVER-87572 lists fix versions 8.1.0-rc0, 8.0.5, and 7.0.22. Check the deployed patch before treating an absent field as zero. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2025-06-12)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/v8.0/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-87572"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:1b6e3bab755ddcec73f65f8db17482fcc133671ff70f80ea120ac08717d34144", "ev:f4aba77409697012297de7cb67be0a4e7793f712c48ec653e4edd573aa6eac7a"]}
{"id": "clm:d55daeb1d6cde36e5042090886f45f5995d530f0f350ab104d1286ce9b41079c", "type": "statement", "text": "MongoDB 8.2 adds classic.replanned_plan_is_cached_plan and sbe.replanned_plan_is_cached_plan. They count replanning operations that produce a plan identical to one already in cache; SERVER-98987 describes this as wasteful replanning and lists 8.2.0-rc0. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-03-09)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-98987"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6a37504fb35aea4500f326e6f29ddecab9a9bc20029bfef001297ac099397afd", "ev:e175c1217b21665ae85247c00f9c697ae831eb709a0bd797809643487dadd0c5"]}
{"id": "clm:2415c46a49aea30ec2d5ec5fd0b07f225aaa5d90ddeccb9c47de9f7f158965ba", "type": "statement", "text": "A rising replanned counter does not prove an index switch: replanning can choose the same plan again. Treat the count as evidence of replanning work, and use the same-plan counters where available to distinguish that outcome. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/serverstatus/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["serverStatus metrics.query.planCache counters"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-98987"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:38b79bd15fdd1f0a7c0c530b9675c9cfb817100a16c448d37aaa089923d077cb", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:3aabcfd90fc5a60ace0c4de95ffc08b2f2e36399966131e18dac867c2b1e93cf", "ev:6a37504fb35aea4500f326e6f29ddecab9a9bc20029bfef001297ac099397afd"]}
